@startuml 
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "User" as User

package "Macro Manager System" {
  usecase "Scan Candy Item" as UC1
  usecase "Handle Unknown Object" as UC2
  usecase "Handle Camera Error" as UC3
}

' Relationships
User --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC3

' Notes to explain the scenarios (Win/Lose/Invalid)
note right of UC1
  <b>Winning Scenario</b>
  User holds candy (e.g. Snickers).
  System detects it (95% confidence)
  and displays calorie info.
end note

note right of UC2
  <b>Losing Scenario</b>
  User holds non-candy (e.g. Keys).
  System fails detection (<40% confidence).
  Displays "Object Not Recognized".
end note

note right of UC3
  <b>Invalid Scenario</b>
  No webcam detected.
  System catches IOError and
  prompts user to connect camera.
end note

@enduml